			<textField textAdjust="StretchHeight">
				<reportElement x="0" y="200" width="555" height="110" forecolor="#000000" uuid="eecbd706-9dfe-465b-890f-85e0bde0baf9"/>
				<textElement textAlignment="Left" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="none">
					<font fontName="Arial Unicode MS" size="9" isBold="false"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["This is to certify that Mr. ARDGDGF (Pension ID No. 151616), retired pensioner from the service (offfff) of the Government of Nepal, has been receiving monthly pension from this office. In the current fiscal year (2082/83), his monthly pension is NPR 10,000.00 and the annual pension"+ "amount is NPR 130,000.00 including festival allowances equivalent to the pension of a month."+
"\n"+
"As per the prevailing exchange rate published by Nepal Rastra Bank, NPR 144.28 is"+
"equivalent to U.S. Dollar (USD) 1 for December 07, 2025 and the annual pension amount is"+
"equivalent to USD 901.03 (Nine hundred one dollars and three cents only)."+
"\n"+
"Note: -No tax shall be levied on the above income as per Section 4 and Schedule 1 of the Income Tax Act, 2058."]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
